{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36319","headline":"题仙岩瀑布呈陈明府 · 方干","name":"题仙岩瀑布呈陈明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"方知激蹙与喷飞，直恐古今同一时。\n远壑流来多石脉，寒空扑碎作凌澌。\n谢公岩上冲云去，织女星边落地迟。\n聚向山前更谁测，深沈见底是澄漪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}